# ByteSpace Design System Enforcement

Always follow these files as source of truth:
- `design/design-system/bytespace.tokens.json`
- `design/design-system/bytespace.design-system.md`

## Mandatory implementation rules

- Build mobile-first and apply responsive upgrades at `sm`, `md`, `lg`, `xl`, and `2xl`
- Use ByteSpace token values for color, typography, spacing, and elevation before introducing new values
- Prefer Tailwind utilities and map token values into config/variables instead of ad-hoc inline values
- Keep forms, cards, and navigation responsive with stack-to-row transitions at `md` and above
- Preserve accessibility: touch targets >= 44px, readable text scales, and no breakpoint-induced horizontal overflow

## Design consistency checks before finalizing

- Verify component spacing uses the defined base spacing scale
- Verify heading/body styles use the documented Poppins/Satoshi pair
- Verify brand palette usage is from Electric Lime, Electric Violet, Persian Blue, Shuttle Gray, and Neutral tokens
- If introducing new tokens, document them in `bytespace.tokens.json` and update `bytespace.design-system.md`
